precedence: (1+(2*3))   and   ((1+2)*3)
subtraction associates left: ((1-2)-3)
division too: ((100/5)/2)
unary minus binds tighter than *: ((-R0C0)*2)
a column is base 26: A1 is R0C0  Z1 is R0C25  AA10 is R9C26
a range keeps both corners: SUM(R0C0:R8C1)
a call takes expressions and nests: IF((R0C0>0),SUM(R0C1:R8C1),0)
a call can take no arguments: NOW()
one comparison is fine: (R0C0<=R0C1)
and the other widths: (R0C0<>R0C1) (R0C0>=R0C1) (R0C0=R0C1)
comparison does not chain: REFUSED at 6: comparison does not chain: parenthesise the comparison you meant
a text literal, with a doubled quote inside: "he said "hi""
whitespace is not syntax: (R0C0+2)
a formula is consumed whole: REFUSED at 4: the formula has more text after its expression
a missing parenthesis: REFUSED at 5: a parenthesised expression is missing its closing parenthesis
rows start at 1: REFUSED at 1: row numbers start at 1
a reference wants a row: REFUSED at 1: a cell reference needs a row number after its column letters
a formula starts with =: REFUSED at 0: a formula starts with =
the edge set of =SUM(A1:B9)+C3 is A1 B9 C3
a formula with no references: (none)
